": "2574086872868973", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162716_173683813225273_921481625584271360_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G3Q5tE5gPGgQ7kNvwHauOAI&_nc_oc=AdkdcZcV4sFd1eKQRRmud5dwwF7QWIpLboHeADvA7nMCeBFYIszaHIaIhBSMBH7Y2E0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftinslvXwm8JzGKFeoxhcDMBGV_fx_Xp3Vco-4-eIbmOQ&oe=69A41EF4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "1713008935524509", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162763_821811624658356_6738265622511091712_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VRom-GjAeVIQ7kNvwHrjGY9&_nc_oc=Adnau3GvTkC76l0qMQ_vAYGeINHG5_GKL-Nj-7aIg4EkL8eatA2uhzEo1M-EKrcrgIo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvlMx9P_woNAa4CRogssIa0Y0aTDmVVNy_e5RaYkkiodw&oe=69A44E9F"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "913276845770000", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162716_309301642809703_3634431536675160064_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EcRTMPcBkYwQ7kNvwEUeWrK&_nc_oc=AdkZ00gT2yMqhUQhZpktVyPteptdWlGaBHwHs--1ieB_X44I6lHFEto5LMgI0G1Umyg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afuew1thUehcvqozu4Gh8fRKmFRZF0HNY-ty-f8U7WRCDA&oe=69A443DE"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "220267052508465", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_322834038196860_322204868838162432_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C27bTXuJEf8Q7kNvwGQtnMI&_nc_oc=AdkKAmGauXQCC65f0YapAPhS6sOjSq5Zypr-s3edI5b2iLEnZ06wxWSDenm4ScY5rio&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftHwxXr9b1NBEDMGBzLL8FmRWBcN0zNIsAlrfsBfLBejA&oe=69A419BE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "75262744_592055948252052_3174710684126543872_n.png", "id": "2273427452851341", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75363516_2273427456184674_5101230653467287889_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=liCvdlQx2D8Q7kNvwEeGXUU&_nc_oc=AdkwfIWmU3IRj37Wz9_e7wJK7n4OpvpR7_a7EoZGacRQHcP1oNBhqfuUgYbu4FRJrPA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftQOyNFFsEy1MmQQpmRSPgiVW7psA9E88ykBnWQ0Aak_w&oe=69A43C72"}, "display_name": "Fail Factory! Demo", "keywords": ["Puzzle", "Casual", "Arcade", "Physics", "Demo"], "long_description": "Immerse yourself in a whimsical robot factory while climbing your way up the corporate ladder from lowly intern to esteemed star employee. In a wacky spectacle of increasing chaos, strive to keep up with the escalating comedy of errors as you operate various assembly lines in a myriad of mini-games. Entrenched in a physics-based, no consequences playground, experience three main types of mini-game stations, all with the goal to help the factory build robots on a massive scale. \n \nWorking in assembly stations, sorting stations and quality assurance protocol (QAP), where you\u2019ll control unfathomably large robots, you\u2019ll hone your skills in a factory that feels reactive and alive, allowing for a fully immersive experience. Designed with approachability in mind, ridiculous failure is inevitable as you work your way to the top in this vibrant, witty and comedic stress-inducing Fail Factory!.", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in a whimsical robot factory while climbing your way up the corporate ladder from lowly intern to esteemed star employee. In a wacky spectacle of increasing chaos, strive to keep up with the escalating comedy of errors as you operate various assembly lines in a myriad of mini-games. Entrenched in a physics-based, no consequences playground, experience three main types of mini-game stations, all with the goal to help the factory build robots on a massive scale."}]}, "developer_name": "Armature Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.meta.com/legal/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.meta.com/legal/quest/games-terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Oculus", "support_website_url": null, "web